---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { author, social } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于" description="关于我" searchScope="all">
  <div class="mb-8">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter">关于</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="border border-black p-8">
    <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-4">
      <div class="flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center border border-black bg-black text-white">
        {author.avatar
          ? <img src={author.avatar} alt={author.name} class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
          : <Icon name="user" size={32} />
        }
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">{author.name}</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">{author.bio}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-sm max-w-none">
      <p>
        这里是岚潮的小窝。设计上追求简洁、清晰，
        全部使用直角和黑白配色，没有任何圆角或渐变。
      </p>
      <p>
        博客包含文章、项目、归档、说说、友链等功能模块。
        文章使用 Markdown 编写，通过 Astro Content Collections 管理。
      </p>

      <h3>技术栈</h3>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {['Astro', 'Vue 3', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Lucide', 'Fuse.js', 'marked'].map((tech) => (
          <span class="inline-block border border-black px-2 py-0.5 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
            {tech}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 联系方式 -->
  <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
    {social.map((link) => (
      <a
        href={link.url}
        target={link.url.startsWith('mailto:') ? undefined : '_blank'}
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-black p-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors hover:bg-black hover:text-white"
      >
        <Icon name={link.icon} size={16} />
        {link.label}
      </a>
    ))}
  </div>
</BaseLayout>